    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the paperwork though. it's everything. every time i try to fix one thing, three more things break. it's like the more i fight to stay afloat, the harder the current pulls. i'm so tired of fighting a system that's designed to fail me. i feel like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, waiting for something to finally just end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
